<div class="container mt-5">
  <div class="card shadow-lg">
    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
      <h3 class="mb-0">🌍 About Us</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <p>
        <strong>Telugu Community Hamburg e.V.</strong> is a non-profit, registered cultural organization founded by
        Telugu-speaking families living in Hamburg and surrounding regions of Germany.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our mission is to preserve, promote, and celebrate the rich heritage, language, and traditions of Telugu culture.
        We organize cultural programs, festivals, youth activities, and social gatherings that bring together families
        and individuals across generations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether it's through classical dance, music, language promotion, traditional festivals, or social service, we aim to
        create a vibrant platform for the Telugu diaspora in Germany to stay connected to their roots while embracing
        diversity.
      </p>
      <p>
        Everyone is welcome to participate, contribute, and be a part of this growing community.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>